SCENE Scene1

ENTITY Player
COMPONENT Transform 300 200 0 12 10
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 2
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas PlayerWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
COMPONENT Script PlayerScript
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_Up PlayerWalk_up
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_Down PlayerWalk_down
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_Right PlayerWalk_right
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_Left PlayerWalk_left
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_UpLeft PlayerWalk_upleft
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_DownLeft PlayerWalk_downleft
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_UpRight PlayerWalk_upright
ADDANIMATION PlayerWalk_DownRight PlayerWalk_downright

ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_Up PlayerIdle_up
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_Down PlayerIdle_down
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_Right PlayerIdle_right
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_Left PlayerIdle_left
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_UpLeft PlayerIdle_upleft
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_DownLeft PlayerIdle_downleft
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_UpRight PlayerIdle_upright
ADDANIMATION PlayerIdle_DownRight PlayerIdle_downright
ENTITYINIT Player

ENTITY Player2
COMPONENT Transform -200 200 0 12 10
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 1
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas BlackWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
COMPONENT Script NPC1Script

ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_Up BlackWalk_up
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_Down BlackWalk_down
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_Right BlackWalk_right
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_Left BlackWalk_left
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_UpLeft BlackWalk_upleft
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_DownLeft BlackWalk_downleft
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_UpRight BlackWalk_upright
ADDANIMATION BlackWalk_DownRight BlackWalk_downright

ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_Up BlackIdle_up
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_Down BlackIdle_down
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_Right BlackIdle_right
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_Left BlackIdle_left
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_UpLeft BlackIdle_upleft
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_DownLeft BlackIdle_downleft
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_UpRight BlackIdle_upright
ADDANIMATION BlackIdle_DownRight BlackIdle_downright
ENTITYINIT Player2

ENTITY Light
COMPONENT Transform 150 200 0 1 1
COMPONENT Light 0.5 0.5 0.5 1.0 500.0

ENTITY AmbientLight
COMPONENT Ambient 0.2 0.2 0.2 1.0

ENTITY Camera
COMPONENT Camera Player
COMPONENT Script CameraScript
ENTITYINIT Camera

ENTITY Road
COMPONENT Transform 000 000 0 12 10
COMPONENT Material RoadMat
COMPONENT Renderer 1 1
COMPONENT Sprite EnviormentAtlas Road1
ENTITYINIT Road

ENTITY Hand
COMPONENT Script HandScript
ENTITYINIT Hand